# Quality and testing

- **Narrow, testable changes.** Name exact target files; do not make broad speculative edits.
- When the change touches code or docs: run **lint/typecheck** and any **repo hygiene / secret scans** your project defines before marking done.
- Prefer scripted checks over ad hoc validation.
